Description: printable weekly routine sheet and year-at-a-glance planner
 A config-driven weekly routine sheet, a year-at-a-glance planner and a web
 control panel, with KDE Plasma desktop-wallpaper rendering. Both planners
 render from a simple YAML schedule to PDF, PNG and SVG; the weekly sheet can
 also be set as a per-screen desktop wallpaper on KDE Plasma.
